WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:01.943
- All right, everybody,

00:00:01.943 --> 00:00:03.963
let's finish up with something
fun from social media.

00:00:03.963 --> 00:00:05.382
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.382 --> 00:00:08.040
(rock music)

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:11.100
So, last week marked the end
of Hispanic Heritage Month.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.020
Our new season hadn't premiered quite yet,

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.520
so let's keep that celebration going

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.590
with an eight-year-old boy recently named

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:18.690
the world's youngest mariachi singer

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.280
in "The Guinness Book of Records."

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.892
This is Mateo.
(audience awing)

00:00:22.892 --> 00:00:25.080
Oh, he's so cute.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.110
He's been performing Mariachi
worldwide since he was four

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.090
and he's just getting started, everybody.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.780
We have Mateo watching
on WOAI San Antonio.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.034
What's up?

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:36.136
(audience cheering)

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:37.852
- Kelly, how are you?

00:00:37.852 --> 00:00:39.150
- I am so good.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:42.240
I love having a fellow Texan
on the show always, Mateo.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:44.940
So, how did you get started in mariachi?

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.830
- I kept following my sister

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:51.830
because I always went to her
performances and all her stuff.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.550
And then one day I really
listened to the music

00:00:56.550 --> 00:01:00.037
and I really loved the
music when I listened to it.

00:01:00.037 --> 00:01:03.650
Also, this is a traje de charro.

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:08.010
It is one of our most important suits

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:10.200
in the Mexican culture.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.870
- Yeah, it's iconic, yeah.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:14.490
So, do you think you
wanna do this forever?

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:15.960
Is this like a thing you wanna do,

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.820
like sing for the rest of your life?

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:21.510
- Yes, I wanna sing
for the rest of my life

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.240
and I'm really having fun

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.630
and I also want to sing all over the world

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:30.150
and be the best mariachi ever.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:31.793
- Yeah.
(audience cheering)

00:01:31.793 --> 00:01:34.410
Oh my God.

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:37.740
Mateo, I'm gonna fly you here myself

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:39.060
and we're gonna sing together.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:40.801
You wanna do that with me?

00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:42.189
- Yes, please.

00:01:42.189 --> 00:01:43.773
- I will sing in Spanish.

00:01:43.773 --> 00:01:47.130
I will sing in Spanish with you, Mateo,

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:48.510
I love you so much.

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:49.680
I more than like you.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:52.365
I'm loving you right now, oh my gosh.

00:01:52.365 --> 00:01:54.090
That's not all though, Mateo,

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:56.370
I wanna tell you our season
long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:59.010
makers of G2, the go-to pen
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:02.640
want to honor truly unstoppable
people just like you, sir.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:05.010
So they're gonna give you $1,000.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:06.280
How's that sound, Mateo?

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:08.415
- Thank you so much.

00:02:08.415 --> 00:02:10.680
(audience cheering)

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:14.596
- Oh my gosh, I love you so much, Mateo.

00:02:14.596 --> 00:02:15.630
You made me so happy.

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:17.160
Thank you to all our guests today,

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:20.161
Arnold Schwarzenegger,
Elmo, Oscar the Grouch,

00:02:20.161 --> 00:02:22.359
Laura Cerand and Hypen,

00:02:22.359 --> 00:02:25.027
